+## Editable right-Sidebar tabs
+
+The `sidebar.right.pane.tab` occupant reads its record through `useTabInfo()`. Its plugin registers `ctx.sidebarRight.beforeClose(sessionId, tabId, guard)` and holds the returned disposer until its owner or record ends. `SidebarRightCloseGuard` accepts a `SidebarRightCloseRequest` with an `AbortSignal` named `signal`, and returns `boolean | Promise<boolean>`; only `true` allows removal. The store waits before publishing a destructive operation, and cancellation, an exception, or a rejected promise retains the layout. Hiding a Sidebar or switching a tab or Session does not request removal. The [right-Sidebar package](../../packages/client/ui-sidebar-right/README.md#the-tab-domain) defines ownership, concurrency and forced-unload semantics.
+
